2558:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\fun     ETH software reset, the MAC and the DMA controller reset the logic
2559:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        and all internal registers of the DMA, MTL, and MAC.
2560:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\param   ETHx (The input parameters must be the following values):
2561:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\          - ETH1
