2564:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\note    1. The software reset status bit (SWR) is automatically cleared after
2565:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        the reset operation is completed.
2566:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        2. Before reprogramming any ETH register, a value of zero should be
2567:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        read in SWR bit.
2568:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        3. The SWR bit must be read at least 4 CSR clock cycles after it is
2569:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        written to 1.
2570:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** **/
